<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Classmate Appreciation</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f8ff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #333;
        }
        .name-button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 10px;
            padding: 15px 25px;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }
        .name-button:hover {
            background-color: #45a049;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Click Your Name to See Your Appreciation Message!</h1>

    <button class="name-button" onclick="showMessage('Emily 🌸, semoga awak jumpa kawan and the best friends outside this old KMPk.. Thank you for surviving a great life with this horrible friend 😂. Good luck PSPM 🍀. Just do your best and not stressing about it 💪.')">Emily</button>
    <button class="name-button" onclick="showMessage('Aina, thank you for being wit me.. dengar cerita karut saya.. stay positive tau.. thank you for bring happiness towards my emotionless life 😁. Jom jalan-jalan. Kalau kamu ada masalah kamu boleh chat aku macam biasa tau. Aku sentiasa ada dengan kau macam mana kau sentiasa ada dengan aku. May Allah crossed our path in future. This 2 years is very meaningful for me. Aku sayang kau.  kindness inspires everyone around you! 🌟')">Aina</button>
    <button class="name-button" onclick="showMessage('Nadia !!! here our beautiful Nad 😍. Nadia aku minta maaf, not being able to take an opportunity for being your truly friend.. aku suka tengok kamu dengan roommate kamu.. maaf sudah tidak buat ups sama ii.. semua menghilang. just for u to know. Youre doing very well. Love you Nadia. Thank you sebab being apart of my friends. I change from emotionless to more happier thank to you.. maaf tak banyak spend time samaii. and if one day someone hurts, citerlah kat aku, aku save no kamu. and one more. aku minta maaf aku selalu terlepas hari jadi kamu.. aku ingat 2 hari, 3 hari sebelum tapi tetap lupa mahu wish.. Maaf nadia, mungkin sebab tu kot kamu jauhkan diri dari kitaorg.. maaf tau. and that the best things you did though. being with someone who appreciate you more.. Sorry nadia 🙁😓 Goodluck pspm ')">Nadia</button>
    <button class="name-button" onclick="showMessage('Sarah, nak tahu sesuatu tak? If someone hurts you just tell the person to stop. dont be in thus toxic relationships where you just smile and accept it. same with me, aku banyak sakitkan hati kamu.. jangan tau. sorry for not being the best friend untuk kamu. one of the reasons aku jauhkan diri dari kamu sebab aku takut, aku makin sakitkan hati kamu now we are classmate for 2 years. youre not overreacting or something. if it hurts you, it hurts you." >Sara</button
    <button class="name-button" onclick="showMessage('Haziqah 💖, good luck Haziqah.. I love your dedication towards study tho 📚. A very hardworking girl 💪. May you always rajin and stay positive tau 🌈.. Jangan sedih-sedih tau 😢. you wanna know one thing youre not sensitive or overreacting. if it hurts you then it hurts you. Your feelings are valid. nobody can make you fell small. 🤗 Allah never changes the condition of the people unless they strive to change themselves">Haziqah</button>
    <button class="name-button" onclick="showMessage('Qeelah 😄, hihihihihi.. Good luck PSPM 🍀. May our path cross in the future tau 🚶‍♀️. Ade masa mesej-mesej me okay 📱.. And update your life tau 📝.')">Qeelah</button>

    <!-- Add more buttons for other classmates -->

    <script>
        function showMessage(message) {
            alert(message);
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>

